What:		/sys/devices/soc/XXX.ufshc/erase_blksize
Date:		March 2017
Contact:	Mohan S. <srmohan@google.com>
Description:
		Query Unit 0 and report the erase block size of the
		underlying device. If the device does not support this
		query, or if the query times out, an error code is returned.

What:		/sys/devices/soc/XXX.ufshc/logical_blksize
Date:		March 2017
Contact:	Mohan S. <srmohan@google.com>
Description:
		Query Unit 0 and report the logical block size of the
		underlying device. Reported value is log(logical blksz bytes).
		If the device does not support this query, or if the query
		times out, an error code is returned.